      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense for the debate. to make it even more persuasive, i want to lean into the idea of \"civilizational progress.\" how can i frame the argument that these systems didn't just provide tools, but actually brought a level of order and modern organizational logic to societies that were maybe too fragmented or \"underdeveloped\" to achieve it on their own at that time? i want to show why the transition to a Western-style state was a necessary step for them to compete globally.",
